      "answer": "[1] src/game/Game.ts:86-100 (method Game.handleGlobalInput)\n```typescript\nelse if (this.input.wasPressed(\"pause\")) {\n  if (this.phase === \"playing\") this.setPhase(\"paused\");\n  else if (this.phase === \"paused\") {\n    // Drop time accumulated while paused so the game doesn't jump forward.\n    this.accumulator = 0;\n    this.setPhase(\"playing\");\n  }\n}\n```\n\n按 Esc 暫停時，如果遊戲正在進行中，則將遊戲狀態設置為暫停。如果遊戲已經暫停，則將累積的時間清零，並將遊戲狀態設置回進行中。",
